<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TOCO SAYS DISPOSAL TALKS CONTINUE, CAUTIONS.</title>
<headline>TOCO SAYS DISPOSAL TALKS CONTINUE, CAUTIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African industrial holdings group Toco Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it was continuing with disposal talks and a restructuring exercise which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>The group therefore cautioned shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>The last cautionary was published on July 7.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
